養的狗隻。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191336635820806144084519.jpeg/eh3XaLhIcPIiTlo7GC72Km2M4iSITikaf_IY3lryGN4\"/><figcaption>貨倉飼養的狗隻。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場有3個用作餵食狗隻的食物兜。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191336643198717952431602.jpeg/iKOhbw0YtJRKJiG75rRRZ4Z-9_UEwh1YnwwZPboMGT0\"/><figcaption>現場有3個用作餵食狗隻的食物兜。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場有3個用作餵食狗隻的食物兜。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191336647128911872813672.jpeg/N0KJdItvO1HrR8RmCrovnu1ExCrhOBB0lXw-iLB8Pog\"/><figcaption>現場有3個用作餵食狗隻的食物兜。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191336641579847680143259.jpeg/cLP6I7X4gmCiDcOzXHbS7Wjp68C7chsiFqeLkjOni5I\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事倉庫。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191338623497277440069587.jpeg/TViZfGO_4M3LxxIIiJhRlO8jWZvqAVRPPv0Vehv9FXo\"/><figcaption>涉事倉庫。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是一個貨倉。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191336636584038400546183.jpeg/OaGWt2bwAEcKOLjl8lBkvDI5BwQ_6l7v3-pQhfrqUIU\"/><figcaption>現場是一個貨倉。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:34.967491+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1465,"images":26,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T03:59:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:30.921906+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:32.369174+00:00","content_hash":"2ae0361550d10b3d55d6061068e02be9859f94109b9b09828f062191285de637","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}